# Review and sign-off of a calculation

The sequence diagram shows who passes what to whom, in order from the top. The numbers under it
estimate the time the review takes for a package of members.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Designer
  participant C as Checker
  participant P as Project engineer
  D->>C: Calculation package
  C-->>D: Comments, round 1
  D->>C: Revised package
  C-->>D: Comments closed
  C->>P: Checked package
  P-->>D: Signed for issue
```

## Inputs
members: 24 | members in the package
t_design: 45 min | design time per member
t_check: 15 min | checking time per member and round
rounds: 2 | review rounds
t_sign: 1.5 h | sign-off by the project engineer

## Time
T_design: members * t_design -> h | design
T_check: members * t_check * rounds -> h | checking
T_total: T_design + T_check + t_sign -> h | total
share: T_check / T_total -> % | share of the time spent checking
